      "message": "I very dislike changes like these. Removing the `const` from declarations that are not definitions is fine (they don\u0027t mean anything), but removing the `const` from defintions is terrible. As a maintainer I want all locals (including parameters) to be marked `const` unless there is a need to do otherwise so there is less need to keep track of potential state.",
